   "title": "Customer Portal Staging: UI elements missing and sorting broken",
   "description": "We are experiencing issues in the staging environment for the Customer Portal. Several key UI elements are failing to render correctly, appearing blank or misaligned. Additionally, the sorting and filtering functions on the main data grids are completely broken and do not apply any changes. This is impacting approximately 814 internal users trying to test new workflows."
