   "i": 22411,
   "title": "Invoice Service Production: Customers receiving duplicate charges",
   "description": "Multiple customers in the EU-West region are reporting that they have been charged twice for their subscriptions. We need an urgent investigation into the Invoice Service as this is resulting in overcharges and potential disputes. About 376 users have been affected so far."
  },
  {
   "i": 22412,
   "title": "Duplicate charges reported via Payment Gateway v2",
   "description": "We are seeing reports of duplicate charges going through the Payment Gateway v2 in the ME region. It is unclear if the issue stems from the gateway processing logic itself or if the requests are being duplicated upstream before reaching it. We need help determining where the redundancy is occurring."
  },
  {
   "i": 22413,
   "title": "Identity Vault Dev: Certificate warnings blocking tests",
   "description": "Developers working in the ME development environment are encountering certificate warnings when interacting with the Identity Vault. These warnings are preventing some automated tests from completing successfully and are causing confusion among the 44 users in the team. The certificates appear valid but are triggering security flags."
  },
  {
   "i": 22414,
   "title": "Payment Gateway v2 Dev: Subscriptions charging twice",
   "description": "In the LATAM development environment, we have observed that subscription renewals are triggering double charges via the Payment Gateway v2. This is affecting test accounts and causing issues with our billing verification processes. 21 users are impacted."
  },
  {
   "i": 22415,
   "title": "Unexpected session expirations with SSO Integration Module",
   "description": "Users in the EU-West production environment are reporting that their sessions are expiring unexpectedly while using the SSO Integration Module. We are not sure if the SSO module is failing to refresh tokens correctly or if the underlying Group Sync Service is causing session invalidation. The issue seems intermittent."
  },
  {
   "i": 22416,
   "title": "Active Directory Sync: Access denied errors and privilege issues",
   "description": "We are experiencing problems with the Active Directory Sync tool in the ME production environment. Users are receiving 'Access Denied' errors despite having the correct permissions defined in AD. Furthermore, some users appear to have elevated privileges that they shouldn't have, suggesting a synchronization failure. This is impacting 44 users."
  },
  {
   "i": 22417,
   "title": "Subscription Manager Sandbox: Refunds not appearing",
   "description": "In the ME sandbox environment, refunds issued through the Subscription Manager are not being reflected in the account balances. The transactions show as processed in the history but the financial state does not update."
  },
  {
   "i": 22418,
   "title": "SSO Integration Module ANZ: Expired links and error pages",
   "description": "Some users in the ANZ production environment are reporting that password reset links generated by the SSO Integration Module are expiring before they can be used. When they try to log in again, they often encounter a generic SSO error page. This affects a small subset of 5 users."
  },
  {
   "i": 22419,
   "title": "Analytics Dashboard EU-West Sandbox: Rate limits and missing webhooks",
   "description": "We are seeing HTTP 429 (Too Many Requests) errors when trying to access data in the Analytics Dashboard in the EU-West sandbox. Additionally, webhooks are not firing as expected. It is difficult to tell if the 429s are coming from the Dashboard's own API limits or if they are being throttled at the Analytics API Gateway level, which might also be preventing webhook delivery."
  },
  {
   "i": 22420,
   "title": "Fee Analyzer Production: Incorrect invoices and chargebacks",
   "description": "High-impact issue in the ME production environment with the Fee Analyzer. Customers are receiving incorrect invoices with wrong proration calculations. This has led to several chargeback notices. 626 users are affected. We need immediate correction of the billing logic."
  },
  {
   "i": 22421,
   "title": "Payment Gateway v2 Dev: Missing env vars and config drift",
   "description": "In the ME development environment, we are detecting configuration drift in the Payment Gateway v2 setup. Some required environment variables are missing or inconsistent across nodes, which is causing connectivity issues for 37 users."
  },
  {
   "i": 22422,
   "title": "Payment Gateway v2 APAC: Duplicate accounts created",
   "description": "We are seeing an issue in the APAC production environment where the Payment Gateway v2 is creating duplicate customer accounts for single requests. This is causing data integrity problems and confusion for 195 users."
  },
